{
  "spec_version": "peer-reconciliation-ref-v1",
  "description": "Conformance vectors for peer-reconciliation-ref-v1. Four invariants are separately recomputable: canonical_envelope, structural_validity, signature_validity, comparator_state. A verifier that treats any pair of present observations as AGREED without checking action_ref equality will silently pass disagreed-001. A verifier that defaults a missing half to AGREED will silently pass unresolved-001.",
  "comparator_rule": "AGREED requires both observed=true, both signatures valid, and matching action_ref. DISAGREED requires both observed=true, both signatures valid, and differing action_ref. Anything else (missing observation, invalid signature on an observed=true party) is UNRESOLVED — never defaulted to AGREED or DISAGREED.",
